{"task_id": "HumanEval/63", "solution": "```python\ndef fibfib(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"The FibFib number sequence is similar to the Fibonacci sequence.\n    This function efficiently computes the n-th element using dynamic programming.\"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return 0\n    if n == 1:\n        return 0\n    if n == 2:\n        return 1\n\n    dp = [0] * (n + 1)\n    dp[0] = 0\n    dp[1] = 0\n    dp[2] = 1\n\n    for i in range(3, n + 1):\n        dp[i] = dp[i-1] + dp[i-2] + dp[i-3]\n\n    return dp[n]\n```"}
