{"task_id": "HumanEval/79", "solution": "```python\ndef decimal_to_binary(decimal):\n    \"\"\"Converts a decimal number to its binary string representation.\n    The result is formatted with 'db' prefix and suffix.\"\"\"\n    if decimal == 0:\n        return \"db0db\"\n\n    binary_str = \"\"\n    while decimal > 0:\n        remainder = decimal % 2\n        binary_str = str(remainder) + binary_str\n        decimal = decimal // 2\n\n    return \"db\" + binary_str + \"db\"\n```"}
