{"task_id": "HumanEval/21", "solution": "```python\nfrom typing import List\n\n\ndef rescale_to_unit(numbers: List[float]) -> List[float]:\n    \"\"\"Given a list of numbers, normalize them to the range [0, 1].\n    The smallest number becomes 0, and the largest becomes 1.\"\"\"\n\n    min_val = min(numbers)\n    max_val = max(numbers)\n    \n    range_val = max_val - min_val\n\n    normalized_numbers = [(num - min_val) / range_val for num in numbers]\n    return normalized_numbers\n```"}
